=== (1) RELIABILITY — the number `#883` never estimated, same estimator both sides ===
  homosexuality 3-item refusal index: **KR-20 = 0.802**  mean refusal 0.202
  35 abortion trios: KR-20 median **0.758** [0.662,0.927] · difficulty median 0.376
